comments[7]:
  - created_at: "2026-09-19T09:04:56.152Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Duplicate check: all-status keyword search changedLinesFromGit returned zero; all 59 replication matches were inspected for matching scope. Closed pm-mrhwow owns semantic activation correctness, not subprocess fanout; its completed behavior must be preserved. Open and in_progress inventories were refreshed. This follow-up remains open and unclaimed; its discovery is the pm-wrbe bulk migration."
    edited_at: "2026-09-19T09:15:14.861Z"
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T13:04:06.116Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Red-first evidence: a real temporary Git repository with 1000 unrelated tracker files and one content trigger executed 3003 patch subprocesses; the new acceptance requires exactly three while retaining all 1001 changed paths. The collector now limits content reads to declared structured triggers and treats partial patch-read failure as unknown evidence."
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T13:27:03.520Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "The real Git regression covers a 1001-path census with only three patch subprocesses, semantic activation equivalence, feature-only clones without a default branch, and partial staged-patch failure remaining fail-closed. Baseline required 3003 patch subprocesses for the same census."
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T13:28:25.951Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: The aborted bootstrap was recovered only after explicit approval and recorded-owner re-verification. Implementation remained isolated during recovery. Git diff collection is read-only and unrelated PM history remains untouched by direct edits; tracker evidence is appended through the CLI.
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T14:30:54.522Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final focused verification passes the real 1001-path Git cost fixture, no-default-branch activation, unreadable staged layer and untracked semantic trigger. Added the untracked case after full coverage identified an unexercised empty-hunk branch; it asserts conservative activation rather than adjusting coverage exclusions. All linked replication tests pass."
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T14:48:33.620Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final local evidence: 9150 tests in 720 files pass. Exact source coverage is statements 64773/64773; branches 49459/49459; functions 13462/13462; lines 61981/61981, with zero skipped coverage. Native Bash 3.2 regression, serial linked tests, temporary-workspace lifecycle, installed helper transport, native Fish/Zsh acceptance and packed npm/npx/bunx smoke pass. Existing thresholds and exclusions were not weakened. GitHub review and CI will validate the submitted delivery head."
  - created_at: "2026-09-20T14:52:55.142Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1281 combines the implementation, regression coverage, package-generated changelog and recorded local evidence. Hosted checks and review findings are attached to the PR head; no published release is claimed for these Unreleased changes."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-20T13:30:46.422Z","harness:codex","Cost is measured by real Git trace events rather than elapsed-time thresholds. One semantic trigger with 1000 unrelated tracker paths needs three patch subprocesses, preserving the full 1001-path census and fail-closed missing evidence."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-20T13:07:35.101Z","harness:codex",A complete changeset census and semantic patch evidence have different consumers. Retain every changed path but collect hunks only for declared structured triggers. Any failed patch layer makes the whole path unknown and therefore activates its ratchet.
